        <body>
            <div xml:id="d404-a7">

                <pb facs="0641" n="571" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg571"/>

                <head>No. 7.</head>

                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">To the Citizen Minister of War :</hi>
                </p>
                <p>In order to try Ferdinand Maximilian and Mejia, the appointment of a military
                    assessor becomes necessary, which must be appointed by the supreme government. I
                    therefore hope you will be pleased to inform me what person must act in that
                    character during the trial, or otherwise authorize me especially to appoint
                    one.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>ESCOBEDO.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
